defined on it will appear to the o/s.  You need to switch over to the the ARC 
console to run the utility from a floppy; it's called RA200-something-or-other 
(ra200.rcu??).  The Mylex controller was called a "raid array 200" by DEC--look 
for that on the dec/compaq/hp site.



